 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Learn the basic words for man, woman, and child, and add their plurals. You' get a lot more Use Let me double-check. I' still stand by it but tell me what you heard. Also learn to say you're a girl, you' a boy, and you' a child. Those four words get you most of the way there. Probably. Most language learners do. The good news is, once you get the basics, people understand what you mean. Learn five or six colours, and practise them every day. You' be surprised in a week.",
